<navigation-bar title="关于我们" back="{{true}}" color="black" background="#FFF"></navigation-bar>

<scroll-view class="page" scroll-y type="list">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="eyebrow">学生项目</view>
    <view class="title">duaa 宿舍电量提醒</view>
    <view class="subtitle">
      面向宿舍电费查询与低电量提醒的小程序，尽量把查电费和提醒这件事做得简单稳定。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">开发者信息</view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-label">昵称</text>
      <text class="info-value">云边的云</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-label">身份</text>
      <text class="info-value">机械学院大三学生</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">开源仓库</view>
    <view class="section-text">
      项目代码托管在 GitHub，欢迎通过仓库提交 issue 或改进建议。
    </view>
    <view class="link-box">
      <text class="link-text">{{githubUrl}}</text>
      <button class="copy-button" bindtap="onCopyGithub">复制链接</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">反馈联系</view>
    <view class="section-text">
      如果遇到数据异常、提醒失败或宿舍信息匹配问题，可以通过邮箱联系。
    </view>
    <view class="link-box">
      <text class="link-text">{{email}}</text>
      <button class="copy-button" bindtap="onCopyEmail">复制邮箱</button>
    </view>
  </view> 

  <view class="section appreciation-section">
    <view class="section-title">我从没觉得敲代码开心过</view>
    <view class="section-text">
      如果这个小程序帮你省了一点查电费的时间，欢迎请我喝杯咖啡 desuwa
    </view>
    <button class="appreciation-button" bindtap="onShowAppreciationCode">查看赞赏码</button>
  </view>


  <view class="version">版本 1.0.1</view>
</scroll-view>

<view wx:if="{{showAppreciationCode}}" class="modal-mask" catchtap="onHideAppreciationCode">
  <view class="appreciation-modal" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="modal-title">感谢支持</view>
    <view class="modal-text">继续把功能做好 desuwa</view>
    <image
      class="appreciation-code"
      src="{{appreciationCodeUrl}}"
      mode="aspectFit"
      show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}"
      bindtap="onPreviewAppreciationCode"
    />
    <button class="modal-close" bindtap="onHideAppreciationCode">关闭</button>
  </view>
</view>
